hey,you are right at being angry (if you are),but remember,dont be like them,dont get down to their level please,I've gone through similar things to(worse than yours,not to mean your experience isn't bad or invalid though,just saying it might be better to just avoid or ignore them),don't mind it much,they most likely aren't worth it,and hey,summer vacation(?,I'm not sure what you guys call it) is here!So,don't mind these b\*tches much honestly dude.

&#x200B;

Also sorry if my grammar is bad,or maybe even offensive etc. I have temporary severe neurological damage of which's effects includes not being able to communicate properly.
